  "intro": "This builder composes SQL WHERE clauses visually from AND/OR condition groups, covering all the standard predicates — comparisons, LIKE, IN lists, BETWEEN ranges and IS NULL checks — and parenthesising groups correctly because AND binds tighter than OR in every SQL engine. Values can be emitted as safely escaped inline literals or as bind parameters in ?, $1, :name or @name style to match JDBC, PostgreSQL, Oracle or SQL Server conventions. It is for developers and analysts assembling non-trivial filters without hand-balancing parentheses.",
